# Deliberately empty of EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL.
#
# That variable is a deployment override and wins over everything in
# `resolveBaseUrl`, including the branch that exists specifically for phones:
# on a device the Metro host is the only address that can reach this machine,
# and `localhost` is the phone itself. Set to localhost here it silently broke
# every device build — the feed never surfaces a network error, so it rendered
# as an empty feed rather than as a failure.
#
# Left unset, each platform resolves correctly on its own: web falls through to
# `extra.apiUrl` in app.json, and a device derives the LAN address from the
# Metro host it is already connected to.
#
# Set it only for a build pointed at a real deployment:
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.example.com
